---

---

<div class="learn-section">
  <div class="learn-container">
    <div class="learn-left">
      <h2 class="learn-title">What you will learn</h2>
      <p class="learn-subtitle">
        Our program is based on properly guiding you through every aspect of the
        scholarship, covering the entire application journey.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="learn-right">
      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">01</span>
        <p class="item-text">Understand the Erasmus Mundus scholarship</p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">02</span>
        <p class="item-text">Navigate the Erasmus Mundus programme catalogue</p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">03</span>
        <p class="item-text">
          Research programs, requirements, and partner universities
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">04</span>
        <p class="item-text">Choose programs that match their interests</p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">05</span>
        <p class="item-text">
          Build a CV the admission committee wants (in European format)
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">06</span>
        <p class="item-text">Write a compelling motivation letter</p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">07</span>
        <p class="item-text">Secure strong reference letters</p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">08</span>
        <p class="item-text">Avoid common application mistakes</p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">09</span>
        <p class="item-text">
          Learn directly from previous scholarship recipients
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-item">
        <span class="item-number">10</span>
        <p class="item-text">Ask questions during an interactive Q&A session</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="learn-footer">
    Many of these are also required for other scholarships and universities, so
    regardless, you'll be prepared for scholarships across the world!
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .learn-section {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 64px 0;
    margin: 0 auto 64px;
    max-width: 1280px;
  }

  .learn-container {
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .learn-left {
    width: 340px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .learn-title {
    font-family: "Zilla Slab", serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 130%;
    color: #1a1b1e;
    margin: 0;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .learn-subtitle {
    font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 150%;
    color: #4a4b4e;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .learn-right {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .learn-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eaeaea;
  }

  .learn-item:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea;
  }

  .item-number {
    font-family: "Zilla Slab", serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 100%;
    color: #364fc7;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 32px;
  }

  .item-text {
    font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 150%;
    color: #2d2e31;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .learn-footer {
    font-family: "Zilla Slab", serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 140%;
    text-align: center;
    color: #1a1b1e;
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  /* Tablet */
  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .learn-section {
      padding: 48px 0;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .learn-container {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .learn-left {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .learn-title {
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 130%;
    }

    .learn-subtitle {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .item-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 145%;
    }

    .learn-footer {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 135%;
    }
  }

  /* Mobile */
  @media screen and (max-width: 560px) {
    .learn-section {
      padding: 36px 0;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .learn-container {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .learn-title {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .learn-subtitle {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 145%;
    }

    .learn-item {
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 12px 0;
    }

    .item-number {
      font-size: 20px;
      min-width: 28px;
    }

    .item-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 140%;
    }

    .learn-footer {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 135%;
    }
  }
</style>
